# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Machine-local agent config
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .mcp.json is written by gsd-pi with absolute paths tied to the local pnpm
# store and node install (see /Users/jim/... prefixes). Not portable to other
# clones, so we don't track it. If a team-shareable variant emerges later
# (commands only, no absolute paths), we can revisit.
.mcp.json

